OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after man found dead
OL,4,Aoutside theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has been launched
OL,7,Fafter a man was found dead outside
OL,8,FNottingham's Theatre Royal.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said emergency
OL,11,Fservices were called to a medical
OL,12,Femergency in Upper Parliament Street at
OL,13,Fabout 12:10 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,15,FA 56-year-old man was found
OL,16,Funresponsive outside the theatre and
OL,17,Fpronounced dead at the scene by
OL,18,Fparamedics. A police cordon placed
OL,19,Fbehind the theatre, in Goldsmith
OL,20,FStreet, has since been removed.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
