OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after man found dead
OL,4,Aoutside theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said the man's death was "not
OL,7,Fcurrently being treated as suspicious"
OL,8,Fand a file was being prepared for the
OL,9,Fcoroner.
